t pursuit led them to fall in love, and they married on impulse."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"After marriage, Kasumi quit her job and chose the path of supporting her husband as a full-time housewife. One reason she chose this path was her desire to have children with her husband soon."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, her husband told her he was still young and felt they could wait at least three years for children. They agreed to always use contraception during sex."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"For Kasumi, who had wanted children since marrying, her husband's reaction was a huge shock. She couldn't hide her distress at realizing her love for him was fading, surprising even herself."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's a capable woman who handles household chores flawlessly, yet she loves cute things and is prone to careless mistakes. Her youth gives her a slightly clumsy charm, making her utterly endearing."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She possesses a young, supple body—boasting a G-cup bust, a slender waist, and a plump, fresh-looking butt—a figure so stunning the protagonist was captivated at first sight."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her voluptuous, supple body, so appealing to men, radiates an aura that suggests she could bear many healthy children."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c138790"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d2/d2bd9555c57cc114d3d71786a51c06def9633e869b5d03cb7d08338e953641a0.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/09/09aef8c8eff61de85455f8413d8e3a6246b84778716419b9eed9ac7f5f496f41.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"藤宮 きせき","creatorId":"vndb:s22396","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s22396","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s22396","name":"藤宮きせき","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native",